          "items": [
            "Best location in Seacrest Beach!! This gorgeous 3 level villa is nestled in between Rosemary and Alys in the family-friendly community of Seacrest Beach on Florida's Emerald Coast. The four bedroom, four bath luxury home overlooks the 12,000 sq foot Seacrest pool -- an ideal location where your family can enjoy cascading pools, lush landscaping, fountains, cabanas, pool-side grill, and grassy lawn. Walk 5 minutes to the beach or take the complimentary golf-cart tram right outside the front door. Park your car and leave it for the week -- you can walk or bike everywhere!<br>The perfect spot for large families and groups, this home's first floor features a complete mother-in-law suite, kitchen and living area (with queen pull-out sofa) along with a queen bedroom and bathroom. This level walks out to the palm lined patio (including a propane grill) and the private gated pool access. The main level on the second floor showcases the great room with a wall of french doors leading to the balcony with a view of the pool and lawn. The open floor plan is the perfect location for groups to gather for cooking, dining, and relaxing. This level also includes a full bathroom, the laundry area, and a bedroom with a queen bed, a daybed with trundle and a balcony overlooking the front of the house. The top floor offers two bedrooms. The master bedroom has an en suite bath with shower and soaking tub and large walk-in closet with a bonus set of bunk-beds (perfect for young children who need to be near mom & dad). The king bed has a view of the wall of doors that lead to the third floor balcony overlooking the pool. <br>The third floor also includes a bunk room with 2 sets of twin-over-full bunk beds with a private bath.<br>The beautiful travertine floors span the top and bottom levels, keeping the house cool and clean. The garage game-room is the perfect hang-out for kids, with a TV, ping pong table, and foosball.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS:<br>- Master Bedroom, Third Floor: King bed & bonus room set of twin-over-twin (sleeps 4 total); private bathroom with shower & tub; walk-in closet; private balcony<br>- Guest Bedroom, Third Floor: 2 twin-over-full bunk sets (sleeps 6); private bathroom with shower-tub combo<br>- Guest Bedroom, Second Floor: queen bed and daybed with twin trundle (sleeps 4 total); hall bathroom with shower-tub combo<br>- Guest Bedroom, First Floor: queen bed; hall bathroom with shower-tub combo<br>- Living Area, First Floor: queen bed pull-out sofa<br><br>HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>- Spacious 3,200 square feet of home.<br>- Wifi<br>- Propane grill<br>- Two fully equipped kitchens (main floor + 1st floor)<br>- Dual living areas (main floor + 1st floor)<br>- Patio + 2 balconies overlooking 12,000 sq ft pool<br>- Flat screen TVs throughout<br>- Complete clean linen participant -- all linens professionally laundered at every checkout!",
